    {
      "id": 134091,
      "name": "DrScott",
      "username": "DrScott",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-26T14:41:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just noticed the banner and was surprized that there wasn't more information since I assumed that the banner had been up for a while. &nbsp;(I don't often pay much attention to those things.) &nbsp;I know GtG shipped Brewcrafters (I got all excited when a GTG package came, thinking I got WotC early), but I thought that was about a new fullfillment service they were offering. &nbsp;I wonder if the merger grew from working with CHMG for the fullfillment, or if the fullfillment was an intermediate step in the merger process?</p><p>In any event I'm excited. &nbsp;I have several DHMG games and enoy them; I think this could be an interesting development.</p><p>New company name: Dice Hate Me Greater Than Games.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
