      "raw": "<p>I just noticed the banner and was surprized that there wasn&#39;t more information since I assumed that the banner had been up for a while. &nbsp;(I don&#39;t often pay much attention to those things.) &nbsp;I know GtG shipped Brewcrafters (I got all excited when a GTG package came, thinking I got WotC early), but I thought that was about a new fullfillment service they were offering. &nbsp;I wonder if the merger grew from working with CHMG for the fullfillment, or if the fullfillment was an intermediate step in the merger process?</p><p>In any event I&#39;m excited. &nbsp;I have several DHMG games and enoy them; I think this could be an interesting development.</p><p>New company name: Dice Hate Me Greater Than Games.</p>",
